                                                "sense_id": "0cef12fc-434d-346c-b827-fdac3fe2fada",
                                                "text": "Alexander died, Alexander was buried, Alexander\nreturneth to dust, the dust is earth, of earth we make\nloam, and of why that loam whereto he was converted\nmight they not stop a beer-barrel?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a0d93db6-0fba-3f90-bfe4-a5f41dac0fd0",
                                        "entry_id": "a824e048-857b-3427-95cb-ed2e4ae61d0e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mixture of sand, clay, and other materials, used in making moulds for large castings, often without a pattern."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
